<h1>Generated Python Program</h1>

```python
from object_detector import Object_Detector_Tool

class Object_Detector_Tool:

    def execute(self, image, labels, save_object=True, saved_image_path="detected_objects"):
        # Implementation of the Python code to detect objects in the image
        detected_objects = self.detect_objects(image, labels, save_object)
        object_number = self.getCountOfObjects(detected_objects)

        return detected_objects, object_number
```

